ocs-studio Debian Package
=========================

Dependencies
------------
To use ocs-studio you need:
- Qt6 or Qt5 (bundled in dependencies)
- PortAudio (libportaudio2)
- libsndfile1
- FFTW3 (libffw3-3)
- espeak-ng (libespeak-ng1)
- libcurl4
- ffmpeg (libffmpeg6 or higher)

Optional dependencies for full functionality:
- ollama: AI voice correction and text rewriting
- llama.cpp: AI voice correction and text rewriting
- whisper-cpp: Speech-to-text transcription
- xvfb: For running tests without display

Usage
-----
After installation, run:
  ocs_studio              # CLI mode
  ocs_studio_gui          # GUI mode

Configuration
-------------
Settings are stored in ~/.config/ocs_studio/settings.json.
